        "valueString": "Sleep remains patchy: on bad nights takes up to 2–3 hours to fall asleep, wakes at 4–5 am, and feels unrefreshed; approximately 3–4 bad nights per week. Slight improvement since last visit after trying breathing exercises and a routine."
